  '11': [['Nursing Admission Histories', ''], ['Yuallerkat Apyutait', ''], ["Nursing admission histories are done for every patient when they come in. Currently, if the patient does not speak English and there is no one available to interpret, we mark every field as 'unable to assess' and the documentation is fairly incomplete. Admission assessments are opportunities to screen people for discharge needs & are designed to make sure that nothing falls through the cracks, so to speak. Here, I'm listing the major questions we ask, and have a short explanation of why if it might not seem intuitive", ''], ['Cacetuqutnguuq ikayungcallerkaq. Iliini ikayungcarraarluteng, yuut angnitelartut wall\xe2\x80\x99 narrluklarait aulukesciulteng cali ukveksagucugngaluku tamarmeng umyualiurtet tuaten ayuqnayukluki. Taugaam umyualiurtetangqertuq ayuqenrilngurnek, ayuqenrilngurnek cingumastekanek, cali ikayungcalria umyualiurtengqerrarkauluni arenqilriamek uitanqegcinarqellriamek-llu. ', '']],
  '10': [['Finding the Right Provider', ''], ['Yuallerkaq Assilriamek Umyualiurtekamek', ''], ['It takes courage to ask for help. Sometimes after taking that courageous step, people can feel unhappy or disappointed with their care and may believe that all providers will be the same. But there are many types of providers, many styles of support, and the patient should always have a provider that fits well and makes them feel comfortable. Asking the right questions when starting therapy is important to make sure that you and your therapist are a good fit and that your needs will be addressed effectively. Remember that your comfort and sense of connection with the therapist are essential. Feel free to ask any additional questions that will help you make an informed decision about whether this therapist is the right fit for you.', ''], ['Cacetuqutnguuq ikayungcallerkaq. Iliini ikayungcarraarluteng, yuut angnitelartut wall\xe2\x80\x99 narrluklarait aulukesciulteng cali ukveksagucugngaluku tamarmeng umyualiurtet tuaten ayuqnayukluki. Taugaam umyualiurtetangqertuq ayuqenrilngurnek, ayuqenrilngurnek cingumastekanek, cali ikayungcalria umyualiurtengqerrarkauluni arenqilriamek uitanqegcinarqellriamek-llu. Arcaqalriaruuq umyualiullerkarpet ayagnerani ellualrianek apqaurillerkaq arenqillerkarpetegnek umyualiurten-llu piyuuteten-llu elluarrluki qanaatekarkaullerpetegnek. Umyuaqluku uitanqegcillerkan assilillerkan-llu umyualiurtemun arcaqalriaruuq.  Nagutaunak apqauraqluten allanek apyutengqerraqavet ikayuutekarkavnek pillerkiurillerkavnun umyualiurta elluatukan elpenun.', '']],
