{'24': {'eTerm': 'Panic Disorders', 'yTerm': 'Umyuam Nangyutii/Naulluutii Kapiayaraq', 'yDesc': "Alqunaq kapialuni cali tukniluni alingellra wall' kapiallra", 'resourceID': '2', 'speakers': [], 'eDesc': 'Sudden and intense episodes of fear or panic'}, '25': {'eTerm': 'Mood Swings', 'yTerm': 'Umyuarem Cimiqetaallra ', 'yDesc': 'Nallunaqluni cimillerkaa umyuaran cali umyuarteqsaraan', 'resourceID': '2', 'speakers': [], 'eDesc': 'Unpredictable changes in mood and emotional states'}, '26': {'eTerm': 'Compulsive Behaviors', 'yTerm': 'Umyuiqsaraq Caurarpallallermun', 'yDesc': "Pulengquurluku callni avitengnaqluku umyuarrlugun wall' arenqiallugun", 'resourceID': '2', 'speakers': [], 'eDesc': 'Repeated actions performed to alleviate anxiety or stress'}, '27': {'eTerm': 'Personality Disorders', 'yTerm': 'Yuum Umyuaranun Nangyutet/Naullutet', 'yDesc': 'Umyuarturyaraa cayaraa-llu ayuqevkenani yuut piciryarait', 'resourceID': '2', 'speakers': [], 'eDesc': 'Patterns of thought and behavior that deviate from social norms'}, '20': {'eTerm': 'Bipolar Disorder', 'yTerm': 'Umyuiqsaraq', 'yDesc': 'Umyuarem cimiqetaallra akuliigni aliayugpagyaraam cali usvilluggluni', 'resourceID': '2', 'speakers': [], 'eDesc': 'Mood swings between depressive and manic states'}, '21': {'eTerm': 'Attention-Deficit/Hyperactivity Disorder', 'yTerm': 'Umyuam Uitasciigatellran/Arulairciigatellran Nangyutiik/Naullutiik', 'yDesc': 'Murilkesciiganani, caqtaarluni umyuarturpailegmi, uitasciiganani-llu', 'resourceID': '2', 'speakers': [], 'eDesc': 'Difficulty focusing, impulsivity, and hyperactivity'}, '22': {'eTerm': 'Suicidal Thoughts or Self-Harm', 'yTerm': "Umyuartuutekellra Ellminek Tuqucugluni wall' Ellminek Akngircugluni", 'yDesc': "Umyuarteqluni ellminek akngirnaluni wall' umyuarteqluni ellminek pitaqnaluni.", 'resourceID': '2', 'speakers': [], 'eDesc': 'Contemplating self-harm or having thoughts of suicide'}, '23': {'eTerm': 'Body Dysmorphic Disorder (BDD)', 'yTerm': 'Umyuam Nangyutii/Naulluutii Ikiukluku Temni', 'yDesc': "Ik'iukuurluku temiini ayuqucia", 'resourceID': '2', 'speakers': [], 'eDesc': 'Obsession with perceived flaws in physical appearance'}, '28': {'eTerm': 'Coping with Life Transitions', 'yTerm': 'Auluksaaraa Yuucim Cimiryaraanun', 'yDesc': "Caperrsugluni yuucimi cimillrinek ukutun avvuyucaramek, calinriryaramek, wall' nuninqigcaramek", 'resourceID': '2', 'speakers': [], 'eDesc': 'Difficulty adjusting to major life changes such as divorce, retirement, or relocation'}, '29': {'eTerm': 'Cultural or Identity Issues', 'yTerm': "Yuuyaraminek wall' Cauciminek Arenqiallugcaraq", 'yDesc': "Cakviurluni ayuqenrilngurnek yuuyaranek, allakaukiyaranek, wall' yuum kitucianek", 'resourceID': '2', 'speakers': [], 'eDesc': 'Struggles related to cultural difference, discrimination, or self- identityy'}, '4': {'eTerm': 'Depression', 'yTerm': 'Umyuiqsaraq', 'yDesc': "Angniiquralleq/Aliayugturalleq, caviirutleq, wall' ilagaucugyuyuilnguq aka'nun", 'resourceID': '2', 'speakers': [], 'eDesc': 'Persistent feelings of sadness, hopelessness, or a lack of interest in activities over an extended period of time'}, '8': {'eTerm': 'Trauma and PTSD', 'yTerm': 'Umyuam Akngiringallra cali PTSD-q', 'yDesc': 'Arenqiallugutet umyuamun-llu caknaanarqellriit taigarrluteng akngirnaqluteng', 'resourceID': '2', 'speakers': [], 'eDesc': 'Distress and emotional difficulties resulting from past traumatic experiences'}, '119': {'eTerm': 'Client Involvement', 'yTerm': 'Kevgiuqekngam Ilagaucaraa', 'yDesc': 'Qaillun amllertalriamek ikayuutelartat kevgiuqekngat ikayungcaryaraamun? Qalaruteksugngaarpuk-qaa quyurtellermegnuk amllertacirkaa ayuqucirkaa-llu assinrullerkaanun wangnun?', 'resourceID': '10', 'speakers': [], 'eDesc': 'How much input do clients typically have in the therapeutic process? Can we discuss the frequency and format of sessions that would work best for me?'}, '120': {'eTerm': 'Approach to Challenges', 'yTerm': 'Cakviurutet Auluksarait', 'yDesc': "Qaillun auluklarciki cakviurutet wall' arenqiallugutet assiringcaryaramegni? Tangruarutmek-qaa qalarcugngauten arenqialliuryaram caliaran tungiinun caliaqellerpenek qaillun-llu taqutellerpenek?", 'resourceID': '10', 'speakers': [], 'eDesc': "How do you handle challenges or conflicts in the therapeutic relationship? Can you provide an example of a challenging case you've worked on and the outcome?"}, '121': {'eTerm': 'Termination and Closure', 'yTerm': 'Iqukliciyaraq Qaqiucilleq-llu', 'yDesc': "Qaillun auluklarcikek assiringcaryaraq iquklitarkaugaqan wall' qaqiuteqataraqan? Canek qalartelarcit wall' pillerkiurilarcit assiringcaryaraq iquklitniaraqan?", 'resourceID': '10', 'speakers': [], 'eDesc': 'How do you typically approach the termination or closure of therapy? What discussions or planning take place as therapy comes to an end?'}, '122': {'eTerm': "What's your name & date of birth?", 'yTerm': 'Kituuga atren, anutiiren-llu?', 'yDesc': '', 'resourceID': '11', 'eNotes': '', 'eDesc': 'Name and DOB are patient safety measures. Patients often have preferred names / nicknames that we write on the board / hand off during our report', 'speakers': [], 'yNotes': ''}, '123': {'eTerm': 'If your heart were to stop, do you want us to do everything?', 'yTerm': 'Ircaqun aruliaqallikan, anirtuusqumauten-qaa?', 'yDesc': "Man'a atengqertuq 'code status-aamek', kangingqerrluni, kia ircaqua arulaiqan, negtaarluku ayagningnaqciqerput, anirtuutekaanek iirukiilluku, aneryaarcetaarluku cupluq iterrluku tuqluanun.", 'resourceID': '11', 'eNotes': "Or, if they don't want those things, whether we change their 'code status' in the chart to DNR / DNI - Do not resuscitate / Do not intubate. If someone wants a custom code status, this can be done too; it's up to them.", 'eDesc': "Formally, this is called 'code status' and refers to whether, if someone's heart stopped, we would do compressions / give emergency medications / intubate. ", 'speakers': ["Man'aatengqertuq'codestatus-aamek'", 'kangingqerrluni', 'kiaircaquaarulaiqan', 'negtaarlukuayagningnaqciqerput', 'anirtuutekaanekiirukiilluku', 'aneryaarcetaarlukucupluqiterrlukutuqluanun.'], 'yNotes': "Wall', tuatnayunrilkata 'code status-aarit' cimirluki chart-aitni DNR-aamun/DNI-aamun- Anirturyaqunaku/cupluliryaqunaku tuqluanun. Kina allamek piyukekngaminek code status-aaryukuni piyugngauq; ellaitnun at'auq."}, '118': {'eTerm': 'Cultural Competence', 'yTerm': 'Yuuyaram Elluatuuyaraa', 'yDesc': 'Qaillun atularciki yuuyarat elluatuuyarat ayuqenriluciat-llu caliarpeni? Kevgiurillruten-qaa ayuqenrilngurnek yuuyaralegnek, qaillun-llu naklegtallren manilarciu?', 'resourceID': '10', 'speakers': [], 'eDesc': 'How do you approach cultural competence and diversity in your practice? Have you worked with clients from diverse backgrounds, and how do you ensure sensitivity?'}, '59': {'eTerm': 'Contempt', 'yTerm': 'Arrsakiyaraq', 'yDesc': "Ilumikun/umyuamikun nekakluku cali/wall' pinarqutlirluku kina/ca tangvaumalria aciqsinruluku wangkutni", 'resourceID': '3', 'speakers': [], 'eDesc': 'An internal rejection and/or judgement toward someone/something which we perceive as being below our standards'}, '58': {'eTerm': 'Disgust', 'yTerm': 'Cumaciyugyaraq', 'yDesc': "Cakneq assikevkenaku wall' quinakiluni camek assinrilngurmek wall' canganarqellriamek", 'resourceID': '3', 'speakers': [], 'eDesc': 'A strong aversion or revulsion toward something unpleasant or offensive'}, '55': {'eTerm': 'Anger', 'yTerm': 'Qenerrneq', 'yDesc': "Tuknilria umyuam ayuqucia an'aqluni alingaqami, assilinritaqami, makugtaqami, wall' umyuara nallaringanritaaqan", 'resourceID': '3', 'speakers': [], 'eDesc': 'An intense emotional response often associated with feelings of fear, displeasure, frustration, or offense'}, '54': {'eTerm': 'Sadness', 'yTerm': 'Angniicaraq', 'yDesc': "Umyuaran ayuqucia aciqsigluni ukutun ilulliqsaraq, iluteqsaraq, wall' angniicaraq", 'resourceID': '3', 'speakers': [], 'eDesc': 'A low emotional state characterized by feelings of sorrow, grief, or unhappiness'}, '57': {'eTerm': 'Surprise', 'yTerm': 'Alaangaaq', 'yDesc': "Umyuam ayuqliriqertellra umyuaqumanrilngurmek wall' alqunaqertellriamek", 'resourceID': '3', 'speakers': [], 'eDesc': 'A bried emotional state in response to something unexpected or suden'}, '56': {'eTerm': 'Fear', 'yTerm': 'Alingun', 'yDesc': "Umyuam nallunairyaraa ellangaqan alingciraaqatni wall' aarnarqellriim, amllerqunek tapengqeraqluni arenqianamek wall' umyuarniurutmek. Avalitait piciuyugngaluni wall' piciuvkenateng", 'resourceID': '3', 'speakers': [], 'eDesc': 'An emotional response to a perceived threat or danger, often accompanied by a sense of unease or anciety. Can be based on real or imagined factors'}, '51': {'eTerm': 'Fear of Dependency ', 'yTerm': 'Aaqluku Elisngaksautellerkani', 'yDesc': "Umyuarniurluni eliyagutellerkaminek umyualiuryaraq wall' umyualiurta", 'resourceID': '1', 'speakers': [], 'eDesc': 'Concerns about becoming dependent on therapy or the counselor '}, '50': {'eTerm': 'Cultural Mistrust', 'yTerm': 'Yuuyaraq Kemyunailkelluku', 'yDesc': "Kemyukevkenaaki umyuamek ikayuriyarat yuuyaraani pitekluku wall' nutem piciryarat", 'resourceID': '1', 'speakers': [], 'eDesc': 'Distrust of mental health services due to cultural or historical factors'}, '53': {'eTerm': 'Happiness', 'yTerm': 'Angniryaraq', 'yDesc': "Tanqigcesnganani umyuam tunginun ukutun, nunaniryuk, elluiyaraq, wall' assililuni", 'resourceID': '3', 'speakers': [], 'eDesc': 'A bright emotional state characterized by joy, contentment, or satisfaction'}, '52': {'eTerm': 'Social Pressures', 'yTerm': 'Yuut Tangvagluki Maligarucaraq', 'yDesc': "Yuut qanellrit wall' neryuniurutait cingumavkenaku ikayungcallerkaq", 'resourceID': '1', 'speakers': [], 'eDesc': 'External pressures or expectation that discourage seeking help'}, '115': {'eTerm': 'Crisis or Emergency Procedures', 'yTerm': "Pinarqeqapiaralria wall' Piqatararpeknaku Aukunarqellriim Maligtaquarkait", 'yDesc': "Caugat auluksarai piqatarraarpeknaku auluknarqellriit wall' pinarqeqapiarluteng arenqiallugtellriit? Qaillun unaksugngaciqsia elpet arenqiallugeskuma pinarqeqapiaralriamek?", 'resourceID': '10', 'speakers': [], 'eDesc': 'What is your protocol for handling emergencies or crises? How can I reach you in case of an urgent situation?'}, '114': {'eTerm': 'Feedback and Progress', 'yTerm': 'Nalllunairiyaaraq Ayagturyaraq-llu', 'yDesc': 'Quyurcaramnuk elluatuucian tungiinun qaillun quyurcilarcit nallunairanek? Umyualiuryaraq calinritnikumku qaillun aulukciqsiu?', 'resourceID': '10', 'speakers': [], 'eDesc': 'How do you gather feedback on the effectiveness of our sessions? What is your approach if I feel that therapy is not working for me?'}, '88': {'eTerm': 'Treatable', 'yTerm': 'Assiriyugngalria', 'yDesc': "Naulluun assiriyugngalria, auluksugngaciquq wall' ikegliyugngaciquq tamana naulluun, taugaam tamarmi catairucesciigaciiqngatuq. Umyuaqluku auluknarqellra ak'anun naulluun, saarralissiyaalriatun auk tequq-llu.  Yuungcarturaquni cali yuuciq kitugareskuni, auluknaqelarciquq cali yuuluaqernaqluni, taugaam tauna naulluun tamarmi assiringaituq", 'resourceID': '5', 'speakers': [], 'eDesc': 'When an illness is treatable, it means that there are ways to manage or alleviate the symptoms of the illness. Think of it like managing a chronic condition, such as diabetes. With ongoing treatment and lifestyle adjustments, you can control the symptoms and  live a healthy life, but the condition might not go away entirely'}, '89': {'eTerm': 'Informal Supports', 'yTerm': 'Allat Cingumastet', 'yDesc': "Yuk ikayurcelluni cali ikayungqerrluni yugnikekngamiinek, ilaminek, wall' allanek ikayuritulinek.", 'resourceID': '6', 'speakers': [], 'eDesc': 'Personal assistance and help that people receive from friends, family, or social networks'}, '111': {'eTerm': 'Specialization', 'yTerm': 'Caliarem Cumigutai', 'yDesc': 'Aulukillruten-qaa arenqiallugutema ayuqinek ciungani? Canek elisngakngavnek cumigutengqercit caliavni?', 'resourceID': '10', 'speakers': [], 'eDesc': 'Do you have experience in dealing with issues similar to mine? Are there particular areas or specialties you focus on in your practice?'}, '110': {'eTerm': 'Therapeutic Approach', 'yTerm': 'Assiringnaqsaraam Ayagyaraa', 'yDesc': "Canek assiringcarrsuutnek wall' kitugutnek aturpallularcit? Qaillun atuyunarilarciki assiringcaryaraaten piyuutaitnun ikayungnaqkevnun? Nalqigcugngaan-qaa qaillun ikayuringnaqlallerpenek yugnun?", 'resourceID': '10', 'speakers': [], 'eDesc': 'What therapeutic approach or model do you primarily use? How do you tailor your approach to the needs of individual clients? Can you explain how you typically work with clients?'}, '113': {'eTerm': 'Collaboration', 'yTerm': 'Calillguteksaraq', 'yDesc': 'Qaillun callilguteklarciki kevgiuqekngat ayagnirilluki assiringcaryaramek? Assiringcaryaram-qaa egmirutekai neryuniurutkai-llu qanaateksugngaarpuk umyuallguteklunuk?', 'resourceID': '10', 'speakers': [], 'eDesc': 'How do you collaborate with clients in developing treatment plans? Can we discuss and agree on the goals and expectations of therapy together?'}, '112': {'eTerm': 'Logistics', 'yTerm': 'Caliarem Ayagyaraa/Eglercaraa', 'yDesc': "Caugat akilitarkaci, insurance-aakun akilicugngauq? Taqi'yaaram alerquutai caugat? Qavcirqunek quyurtelartat, cauga-llu taktacia?", 'resourceID': '10', 'speakers': [], 'eDesc': 'What are your fees, and do you accept insurance? What is your cancellation policy? How often are sessions scheduled, and what is the typical duration?'}, '82': {'eTerm': 'Coping Strategies', 'yTerm': 'Qaillun Auluksaurcugngariyaraq', 'yDesc': "Yuut qaillun aulukitullrat umyuamun arcarillret, cakviurutet, wall' capernarqellriit umyuarniurutet.  Ilakluki ayuqenrilnguut callrit, umyuartuutet, wall' yuut ikayuutait qaillun ayagturallerkaatnun cakviungermeng.", 'resourceID': '5', 'speakers': [], 'eDesc': 'Ways people deal with and manage stress, challenges or difficult emotions. These can include various actions, thoughts, or behaviors that help people navigate tough situations'}, '83': {'eTerm': 'Healing', 'yTerm': 'Mamyaraq', 'yDesc': "Calricaaraq tamalkuurcaraq-llu.  Aturnarqelartuq utumariyaraq assiriinallerkaq-llu naulluurraarluni, umyuaq akngirterrarcelluku, wall' arenqialliurraarcelluku.", 'resourceID': '5', 'speakers': [], 'eDesc': 'The process of becoming healthy and whole again. It often involves recovery and improvement after a period of illness, trauma, or distress. '}, '80': {'eTerm': 'Openness', 'yTerm': 'Allakaukinailnguq', 'yDesc': "Ciuniuriyugngaluni umyuartuuteksugngaluki-llu nutaarat pillerkat, qaillun tangvaumallrit, wall' callrit.", 'resourceID': '4', 'speakers': [], 'eDesc': 'Willing to accept and consider new ideas, perspectiives, or experiences'}, '81': {'eTerm': 'Hesitation', 'yTerm': 'Nasperturyaraq', 'yDesc': "Pillerkiuringnaqkuni wall' caqataquni arulaiqerluni wall' qariqerrluni, ancurtuami, asguranakngamiu, wall' ellminek kemyukenrilami cucukinritnayukluni assinranek.", 'resourceID': '4', 'speakers': [], 'eDesc': 'A temporary pause or delay in decision-making or action, often stemming fom uncertainty, doubt, or lack of confidence in choosing the best course of option'}, '86': {'eTerm': 'Habits', 'yTerm': 'Piuryarat', 'yDesc': "Cimiyuinateng, amllerqunek elpeksuunaku, piciryarait yuut piciryaraksagutellrit yuucimegni. Piciryarat assiryugngaut wall' assiicugngaut, agtuumaluki cayarait yuuyarait-llu.", 'resourceID': '5', 'speakers': [], 'eDesc': 'Consistent, often unconscious, behaviors that people develop throughout their lives. Habits can be both positive and negative, influencing daily routines and lifestyle choices'}, '87': {'eTerm': 'Curable', 'yTerm': 'Mamyugngalria', 'yDesc': "Naulluun mamyugngalriarukuni, kangingqerciquq yuungcaryugngaluni wall' naulluun arulaivkangnaqluku catairutlerkaanun tamalkuan. Tangruarluku kitugillerkaa arenqiallugutem ayagniartuq taqluni, iinrukiitellriatun pupik pitekluku. Iinruk calikuni naulluun catairuciiquq, peng'garnairulluni-llu tainqigtellerkaanek.", 'resourceID': '5', 'speakers': [], 'eDesc': "When an illness is curable, it means that there is a treatment or intervention that can completely get rid of the illness. Imagine it like fixing a problem so that it foes away permanently, like successful, the illness is gone, and you don't have to worry about it coming back."}, '84': {'eTerm': 'Support', 'yTerm': 'Cingumayaraq', 'yDesc': "Allat ikayurluku, cingumaluku, wall' qarulluku, ukutun yugnikekngat, ilait, wall' nunalgutaita.  Cingumayugngauq umyuarakun, aipaqluku, wall' tamarkenka.", 'resourceID': '5', 'speakers': [], 'eDesc': 'Assistance, encouragement, or comfort provided by others, such as friends, family, or a community. Support can be emotional, practical, or both'}, '85': {'eTerm': 'Harm Reduction', 'yTerm': 'Ikgelicarluku akngirun', 'yDesc': "Ikeglingnaqluki aarnarqellriit ayuqucii wall' uitallra, taugaam tamalkuita arulaircetevkenaki aarnarqellriit atuqekngai.  Ikgenaki cimiryarait cakviurnarqelartut ak'anun.", 'resourceID': '5', 'speakers': [], 'eDesc': 'An approach focused on reducing  the risks of certain behaviors or conditions, without completely stopping all the behaviors themselves. Small changes over time can have major long-term effects.'}, '3': {'eTerm': 'Lack of Trust', 'yTerm': 'Ukvernailkiyaraq', 'yDesc': "Peng'garutekluku allanun qanrutkesciigacaaraq cali ukvernarqucia umyualiurutem.", 'resourceID': '1', 'speakers': [], 'eDesc': 'Concerns about confidentiality and whether they can trust the counselor '}, '7': {'eTerm': 'Stress', 'yTerm': 'Umyuarniuryaraq', 'yDesc': "Umyuartuuteksiyaallran camek wall' umyuartuscigatellran umyuiqengevkarluku temii-llu naulluvkangluku", 'resourceID': '2', 'speakers': [], 'eDesc': 'Overwhelming pressure or tension that affects mental and physical health'}, '108': {'eTerm': 'Maintenance', 'yTerm': 'Aulukuuryaraq', 'yDesc': "Yuum caliaquurluki cimirturallni cimirtuuryaram nallini. Mat'um cimirtuuryaram caliaqaa ataam ayuqelallmitun pinritengnaqsaraq cali elluatmun ayangnaquurluni.", 'resourceID': '9', 'speakers': [], 'eDesc': 'The person works to keep the changes made during the action stage. This stage involves preventing relapse and consolidating gains.'}, '109': {'eTerm': 'Credentials and Experience', 'yTerm': 'Piciutassillerkaa Calillra-llu', 'yDesc': "Canek elitnaullrusit cali elicungcallrusit? Qaillun taktalriamek calillrurcit umyualiurtenguluten? Ciungani-qaa caliaqelallruaten [aperturiluten arenqiallugutnek wall' amllertaciit]?", 'resourceID': '10', 'speakers': [], 'eDesc': 'What is your educational background and professional training? How long have you been practicing therapy? Do you have experience working with [specific concerns or populations]?'}, '102': {'eTerm': 'Guardianship and Incapacity', 'yTerm': 'Aulukiyaraq cali Casciigalnguq', 'yDesc': "Kina yuk pillerkiurciigalkan ellminek, ataniuryaram ellminek ilaksugngaa qanercetaarvigkun aulukestekiilluku tauna.  Wat'nangraan, taringnarqerkauguq cali umyuaqluku yuum piyuutii arcaqakekngai-llu.", 'resourceID': '8', 'speakers': [], 'eDesc': "In cases where a person lacks the capacity to make decisions for themselves, autonomy may involve appointing a legal guardian for them. Even in these situations, efforts should be made to understand and consider the individual's wishes and values."}, '103': {'eTerm': 'Educating and Empowering Patients', 'yTerm': 'Elicungcarluki Atanrurtelluki Inrivigtellriit', 'yDesc': 'Ellminek ataniuryaram ilakaa inrivigtellriit piyunarqucilirluki ilagaucugngallrit nallunairutnek ikayuutekanek-llu pillerkiurillratni calricaaramegnek. Ilakluki elicungcarluki naullutaitnek, yuungcarsutekaitnek, ellaitnek pillerkiuraita auluksaraitnek-llu.', 'resourceID': '8', 'speakers': [], 'eDesc': 'Autonomy involves empowering patients with information and resources to actively participate in their healthcare decisions. This includes providing education about their medical conditions, treatment options, and self-management strategies.'}, '100': {'eTerm': 'Refusal of Treatment', 'yTerm': 'Yuungcaasqumanritellerkaq', 'yDesc': "Iinrivigtellriit piunarqucingqertut ciuniunricugngaluki yuungcaryarateng, calricaariurtet ukvengraatki assirniluku taumun. Ciuniurinritleq qigcikumaarkauguq, cali qalarutkarkaugut allaggun yuungcallerkamek wall' qaillun piciqellranek ciuniurumanrilkan yuungcarrsuutekaa.   ", 'resourceID': '8', 'speakers': [], 'eDesc': 'Patients have the right to refuse medical treatment, even if healthcare providers believe it is in their best interest. This refusal should be respected, and alternative options or consequences should be discussed.'}, '101': {'eTerm': 'Cultural Competence', 'yTerm': "Yuuyaram At'uuyugngallra", 'yDesc': 'Ellminek ataniuryaram elitaqumaa arcaqaucia yuuyaraq calricaarmi.  Calricaariurtet elpekumarkaugait yuuyaraat iinrivigtellriit cali yungcarillermeggnun aturluki pinarqekan.', 'resourceID': '8', 'speakers': [], 'eDesc': 'Autonomy recognizes the importance of cultural competence in healthcare. Healthcare providers should be sensitive to the cultural backgrounds of their patients and adapt their approach to treatment accordingly. '}, '106': {'eTerm': 'Preparation', 'yTerm': 'Upcaraq', 'yDesc': 'Yuk umyuangellruuq cimiryugluni. Ayagniriluni pillerkiuramek cimirnaluni cukaunani-llu ayagniqcaarluni cimillerkaminun.  ', 'resourceID': '9', 'speakers': [], 'eDesc': 'The person has decided to make a change. They may begin planning and taking small steps toward change.'}, '107': {'eTerm': 'Action', 'yTerm': 'Emirulluku/Ayagnirluku', 'yDesc': 'Yuum ayuquciini egmirulluku cimingnaqluni ayuqsullerminun.  Una cimiryaraq tangernarqellriaruuq elitaqnaqluteng-llu cimirturallra ayuquciaggun.', 'resourceID': '9', 'speakers': [], 'eDesc': 'The person actively engages in behaviors to make the change they want. This stage involves the most visible and noticeable changes in behavior.'}, '104': {'eTerm': 'Precontemplation', 'yTerm': 'Cimirngaicuklukuaq', 'yDesc': "Yuk umyuarturpeknani cimillerkaminek.  Aipagni tayima elpekenritaa wall' cimirnarqenricuklukuarluni. ", 'resourceID': '9', 'speakers': [], 'eDesc': 'The person is not yet considering change. They may be unaware or in denial of a need for any change.'}, '105': {'eTerm': 'Contemplation', 'yTerm': 'Umyuartuuteksaraq', 'yDesc': 'Yuum elpekluku cimirnarqellni taugken nalirruggluni.  Yuvriryugngaat cimillerkam assillra assinritellra-llu.', 'resourceID': '9', 'speakers': [], 'eDesc': 'The person is aware of the need for change but is undecided. They may weigh the pros and cons of changing.'}, '39': {'eTerm': 'Uncertainty about Effectiveness', 'yTerm': 'Ikayuutngungaicuklukuarluku', 'yDesc': "Umyuarani kapucimavkenani umyualiullerkaq ikayuutnguciqellranek wall' cimircecugngaciiqellranek assitmun", 'resourceID': '1', 'speakers': [], 'eDesc': 'Doubts about whether counseling will be helpful or make a difference'}, '38': {'eTerm': 'Denial', 'yTerm': 'Piciunritniyaraq', 'yDesc': "Arenqialluguceteng arcaqalriarunritniluku wall' ciuniurpeknaku ikayuanarqellni", 'resourceID': '1', 'speakers': [], 'eDesc': 'Reluctance to admit how serious their issues are or to acknowledge the need for help'}, '33': {'eTerm': 'Lack of Direction', 'yTerm': 'Yuucimini Callerkani Nalluluku', 'yDesc': "Ciunerkaunani wall' uunguciinani yuucimi eglertellerkaanek wall' yuuciqnayuklukuallminek", 'resourceID': '2', 'speakers': [], 'eDesc': "Feeling lost or uncertain about one's life path or purpose"}, '32': {'eTerm': 'Chronic Pain', 'yTerm': 'Nangamcugcaraq', 'yDesc': 'Avegteqluni tememinek-llu nangtequurluni', 'resourceID': '2', 'speakers': [], 'eDesc': 'Emotional challenges associated with persistent physical pain'}, '31': {'eTerm': 'Lack of Motivation', 'yTerm': "Cay'uumiicaraq", 'yDesc': 'Caperrsugluni tengruvkenani-llu cayullmi egmirutellerkaanek', 'resourceID': '2', 'speakers': [], 'eDesc': 'Difficulty finding the drive or energy to pursue goals'}, '30': {'eTerm': 'Social Anxiety', 'yTerm': 'Yuut Avatiitni Uitallerkam Umyuarniurutii', 'y