calm and unstrained mental state often associated with a sense of ease or transquility'}, '2': {'eTerm': 'Perceived Weakness', 'yTerm': 'Kemyukenricuklukuaryaraq', 'yDesc': "Ukverumaluku ikayucalleq cirliqnakluku wall' pinianaqniluku", 'resourceID': '1', 'speakers': [], 'eDesc': 'Belief that asking for help is a sign of weakness or not being strong enough'}, '6': {'eTerm': 'Relationship Issues', 'yTerm': 'Aipaqucaram Nagutai/Arenqiallugutai', 'yDesc': "Umyuallgutkevkenateng, taringucuunateng, wall' arenqiallugutengqerrluteng aipaqucaramun", 'resourceID': '2', 'speakers': [], 'eDesc': 'Conflicts, communication problems, or difficulties in personal relationships'}, '99': {'eTerm': 'Confidentiality', 'yTerm': 'Qalarutkumaarkaunrilnguut', 'yDesc': "Qigcikiyaraq ellminek ataniuriyaaramek ilangqertuq qalarutkarkaunritellranek iinrivigtellriim nallunairutainek.  Iinrivigtellriit kemyunakarkaugait calricaaraata nallunairutait qanrutkumaarkaunritellritnek apterraarpailgan at'uusqelluku qaillun.", 'resourceID': '8', 'speakers': [], 'eDesc': 'Respecting autonomy includes ensuring the confidentiality of patient information. Patients should feel confident that their personal health information will be kept private unless they give clear permission for it to be used in specific ways.'}, '98': {'eTerm': 'Shared Decision-Making', 'yTerm': 'Ikayuqulluteng Pillerkiuriyaaraq', 'yDesc': 'Ellminek ataniuriyaaram cingumalarai calricaariurtet calillgutkesqumaaluki iinrivigtellriit ilakluki pillerkiurillerkait kiingan arenqiallugutait auluklerkai tangvagpeknaku. ', 'resourceID': '8', 'speakers': [], 'eDesc': 'Autonomy encourages providers to work together with their patients for all decision making rather than choosing what should be done about any identified problems alone. '}, '91': {'eTerm': 'Protective Factors', 'yTerm': 'Qaunqiyaarat', 'yDesc': "Yuucim iliin wall' avatiin quyigikanircetlaraa pinirikanircelluku ikayurluku-llu aulukluku umyuarniurun capernarqellriit-llu. Ikayuutelartut yuum calricaraanun cayailkucilriatun-llu ayuqluku umyuarniurutkanun.", 'resourceID': '6', 'speakers': [], 'eDesc': "Parts of a person's life or environment that increase their resilience and help them manage stress and difficulties. They contribute to a person's well-being and can act as a buffer against stressors."}, '90': {'eTerm': 'Community Resources', 'yTerm': 'Nunaitni ikayungcarviit', 'yDesc': "Kevgiurutet, quyungqalriit ikayurtet, wall' caliviit paivngalriit nunani cingumastenguluteng, ikayuriluteng, wall' nallunairiluteng yugnun. Makut ikayuutet ilangqersugngaut calricaram kevgiuriyaaraanek, nunat quyurrvigkaatnek, elitnauryaranek, allanek-llu.", 'resourceID': '6', 'speakers': [], 'eDesc': 'Services, organizations, or facilities available within a community that provide support, assistance, or information to residents. These resources can include healthcare services, community centers, educational programs, and more. '}, '93': {'eTerm': 'Treatment Plan', 'yTerm': 'Yuungcallerkam pillerkiuraa', 'yDesc': "Iinrivigmi calistet ayagnillrit apertumanqegcaraumalria atuyunarqellria-llu pillerkiuraq caliaqsugluku yuum calricaraa wall' arenqiallugutii. Pillerkiulartuq ikayullerkaanek, qaillun assiringcallerkaanek, egmirutekaanek-llu piyuutiin unakellerkaanek.", 'resourceID': '7', 'speakers': [], 'eDesc': "A detailed and structure strategy developed by healthcare professionals to address an individual's specific health or behavioral issues. It outlines the intended interventions, therapeutic approaches, and goals to achieve the desired outcomes"}, '92': {'eTerm': 'Risk Factors', 'yTerm': 'Aarnarqellriit', 'yDesc': "Yuum yucian iliin arcariluki assinrilnguut wall' arenqiallugutait.", 'resourceID': '6', 'speakers': [], 'eDesc': "Parts of a person's life that increase the likelihood of negative outcomes or problems"}, '95': {'eTerm': 'Objective', 'yTerm': 'Picirkiurun', 'yDesc': "Apertuumanqegcaarluni, cuqcugngaluku, cali apertuutet taqlerkiurangqerrluteng wall' egmirutekait atuyunaqluteng yungcaryaraan pillerkiuraini.  Egmirutekat picirkiurutet-ggun atuyunarilartut ikeglillrit-ggun, auluksunarillrit-ggun, qacignarivkarluki cuqtellerkait assiriinaryaramun cali elluarillerkamun.", 'resourceID': '7', 'speakers': [], 'eDesc': 'Specific, measurable, and time-bound steps or actions designed to achieve the broader goals outlined in a treatment plan. Objectives break down the goals into smaller, manageable components, making it easier to track progress and success.'}, '94': {'eTerm': 'Goals', 'yTerm': 'Egmiruutet', 'yDesc': "Qanerniarutet aperturiluteng iqukanek wall' cimirluki yuum piukekngai. Assirillerkam pillerkiuraani, egmirutekiulartut assirillerkam tunginun cali utumarillerkamun.", 'resourceID': '7', 'speakers': [], 'eDesc': 'Broad, overarching statements that describe the desired results or changes a person aims to achieve. In the context of a treatment plan, goals provide a general direction for progress and improvement'}, '97': {'eTerm': 'Respecting Preferences', 'yTerm': 'Qigcikluki Piyuutait', 'yDesc': "Calricaariurtet qigcikarkaugait cali umyuartuutekluki iinrivigtellriit piyuutait arcaqakekngait-llu.  Elitaqumaarkaugait yuut ayuqenrilngurnek yuuyarangqellrit, agayumaaciit, wall' ukverutait calricaaram pillerkiuryaraan tungiinun. ", 'resourceID': '8', 'speakers': [], 'eDesc': 'Healthcare professionals should respect and consider the individual preferences and values of their patients. They must recognize that people may have diverse cultural, religious, or personal beliefs that influence their healthcare decisions.'}, '96': {'eTerm': 'Informed Consent', 'yTerm': 'Nallunrirceciiyaraq', 'yDesc': "Ellminek ataniuryaram ayuqeqapigta nallunrirceciiyaraq.  Iinrivigmi cavailgatgu wall' yuungcarpailgatgu, calricaariurtet nallunaircetarkaugait yuungcarvigtellriit nallunaircelluki ayuqenrilngurnek ikayutekaitnek, ilaluki aarnarqutaitnek, ikayutekaitnek, allanek-llu piyugngallritnek. ", 'resourceID': '8', 'speakers': [], 'eDesc': 'Autonomy is closely tied to the concept of informed consent. Before any medical procedure or treatment, healthcare providers should provide patients with any available information about the types of help they are suggesting, including potential risks, benefits, and alternatives. '}, '11': {'eTerm': 'Eating Disorders', 'yTerm': 'Neqkatgun Umyuiqsaraq', 'yDesc': 'Civuuratet assinrilngurteggun nerurallritgun, temem ayuqellerkaanun, uqamaltacianun-llu', 'resourceID': '2', 'speakers': [], 'eDesc': 'Concerns related to unhealthy eating habits, body image, and weight'}, '10': {'eTerm': 'Substance Abuse', 'yTerm': 'Caarrlugnek Aturpallalleq', 'yDesc': "Cakviurutai taangam, iinrurrluut wall' allat-llu taqesciigatnarqellriit", 'resourceID': '2', 'speakers': [], 'eDesc': 'Struggles with alcohol, drugs, or other addictive behaviors'}, '13': {'eTerm': 'Sleep Disturbances', 'yTerm': 'Qavarciigacaarat', 'yDesc': "Qavarciiganani, qavarturluni, wall' qavakegciluni", 'resourceID': '2', 'speakers': [], 'eDesc': 'Difficulty falling asleep, staying asleep, or experiencing restful sleep'}, '12': {'eTerm': 'Self-Esteem Issues', 'yTerm': 'Ellminek Arenqiallugutet', 'yDesc': "Ellminek arcaqakevkenani, ayuquciini tangvacurlagluku, wall' kemyukevkenani", 'resourceID': '2', 'speakers': [], 'eDesc': 'Low self-worth, negative self-perception, or a lack of confidence'}, '15': {'eTerm': 'Workplace Stress', 'yTerm': 'Caliviim Umyuarniurutai', 'yDesc': "Cakviurutet/Arenqiallugutet tunginun caliaqegciyaraam, calilnguqercaram/caliaminek puukaucaraq, wall' caliaran yuucian-llu arenqigingnaqsaraan", 'resourceID': '2', 'speakers': [], 'eDesc': 'Challenges related to job satisfaction, burnout, or work-life balance'}, '14': {'eTerm': 'Anger Management', 'yTerm': 'Qenqercukaarallrem Auluksaraa', 'yDesc': 'Qenqercukaarluni cali allagun assinrakun ancesciiganaku/qenertenrilkurcesciiganani', 'resourceID': '2', 'speakers': [], 'eDesc': 'Difficulty controlling anger and expressing it in a healthy way'}, '17': {'eTerm